{"strongs": "H5459", "word": "סְגֻלָּה", "translit": "se.gul.lah", "root": "סגל", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "possession, property", "definition": "סְגֻלָּה noun feminine possession, property (on formation see Ba NB § 95 b Kö ii. 1, 168 ); — absolute ׳ ס Exod 19:5 + 5 t.; construct סְגֻלַּת Eccl 2:8 suffix סְגֻלָּתוֺ Ps 135:4 — 1. valued property, peculiar treasure , which ׳ י has chosen ( בחר ) and taken to himself; always of people of Israel, first Exod 19:5 ( E ; ᵐ5 λαὸς περιούσιος = Titus 2:14 ; 1Pet 2:9 λαὸς εἰς περιποίησιν = περιποίησις Eph 1:14 compare Br MP 102 ; MA 52, 235); then ׳ עַם ס Deut 7:6 ; Deut 14:2 ; Deut 26:18 later ׳ ס alone, Mal 3:17 ; Ps 135:4 . 2. treasure (very late), of kings 1Chr 29:3 (gold and silver), Eccl 2:8 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5496')\">BDB5496</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5459')\">H5459</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5495')\">BDB5495</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5497')\">BDB5497</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>סְגֻלָּה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>possession, property</highlightword> (on formation see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB § 95 b</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 1, 168</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 19:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,5)\">Exod 19:5</ref> + 5 t.; construct <bdbheb>סְגֻלַּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,8)\">Eccl 2:8</ref> suffix <bdbheb>סְגֻלָּתוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 135:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"135\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"135\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,135,4)\">Ps 135:4</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>valued property, peculiar treasure</highlight>, which <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> has chosen (<bdbheb>בחר</bdbheb>) and taken to himself; always of people of Israel, first <ref ref=\"Exod 19:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,5)\">Exod 19:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>λαὸς</grk> <grk>περιούσιος</grk> = <ref ref=\"Titus 2:14\" b=\"56\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(56,2,14)\">Titus 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Pet 2:9\" b=\"60\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(60,2,9)\">1Pet 2:9</ref> <grk>λαὸς εἰς περιποίησιν</grk> = <grk>περιποίησις</grk> <ref ref=\"Eph 1:14\" b=\"49\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(49,1,14)\">Eph 1:14</ref> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>MP 102</sup></lookup>; MA 52, 235); then <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַם ס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,6)\">Deut 7:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 14:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,14,2)\">Deut 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 26:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,18)\">Deut 26:18</ref> later <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ס</bdbheb> alone, <ref ref=\"Mal 3:17\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,17)\">Mal 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 135:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"135\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"135\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,135,4)\">Ps 135:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>treasure</highlight> (very late), of kings <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,3)\">1Chr 29:3</ref> (gold and silver), <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,8)\">Eccl 2:8</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 19:5", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 19, "verse": 5}, {"